 # todo
 
-A small CLI todo manager backed by a JSON file. `python -m todo.cli --file t.json add "x"`.
+A small CLI todo manager. By default it stores tasks in SQLite at `~/.todo.db`
+(override with `--file PATH` or the `TODO_FILE` env var). The backend is chosen
+by extension: `.json` uses a JSON file, anything else uses SQLite.
+
+```
+python -m todo.cli add "x"                 # writes to ~/.todo.db
+python -m todo.cli --file t.json add "x"   # JSON backend
+python -m todo.cli rename 1 "new title"
+python -m todo.cli migrate old.json new.db # copy tasks between backends (either direction)
+```
+
+`migrate` preserves ids, done flags, `created_at` and tags, and refuses to
+touch a non-empty destination.
+
 Tests: `python -m pytest -q`.
